sta de caminhada, ciclovias e áreas de convivência.\n• Mobilidade: fácil acesso às principais vias e ao Campina do Siqueira Bus Terminal, conectando você ao transporte coletivo da cidade.\n• Cultura \\u0026 Diversão: região com bares, cafés e restaurantes ao longo do bairro, além da Livrarias Curitiba para momentos de lazer.\n\nAgende sua visita e descubra como é viver com qualidade e praticidade!\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a alteração sem aviso prévio.\n\n#CuritibaImóveis #CampinadoSiqueira #AugenResidence #ApartamentoÀVenda #QualidadeDeVida #LazerCompleto #ImóveisCuritiba25:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"details\":{\"id\":\"ee87bc80-4a89-49a5-85","fotos":["https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150942/fachada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150946/1645140-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150946/1645139-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150946/1645138-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150946/1645137-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150946/1645136-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206150959/1645135-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206151002/1645134-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206151003/1645133-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206151026/1645132-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20260206151006/1645131-watermarked.webp","https://d38